msgid "备注"
msgstr "Remark"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/polygon_zone_display.rst:31
msgid "可选备注信息，记录用途。"
msgstr "Optional remark information to record the purpose."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/polygon_zone_display.rst:32
msgid "``留空``"
msgstr "``leave blank``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/polygon_zone_display.rst:33
msgid "输入图像"
msgstr "input image"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/polygon_zone_display.rst:34
msgid "用于可视化的图像来源。"
msgstr "Image source used for visualization."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/polygon_zone_display.rst:35
msgid "``input.image``"
msgstr "``input.image``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/polygon_zone_display.rst:36
msgid "复制图像"
msgstr "copy image"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/polygon_zone_display.rst:37
msgid "是否先复制输入图像再进行可视化，保留原始帧。"
msgstr ""
"Whether to copy the input image before visualization, retaining the original"
" frame."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/polygon_zone_display.rst:38
msgid "``True``"
msgstr "``True``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/polygon_zone_display.rst:39
msgid "区域形状"
msgstr "area shape"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/polygon_zone_display.rst:40
msgid "多边形区域（每个挨个一个）以 ``[[x1,y1], [x2,y2], [x3,y3], ...]`` 表示，每个区域需至少 3 个点。"
msgstr ""
"Polygonal areas (one after another) are represented by ``[[x1,y1], [x2,y2], "
"[x3,y3], ...]``, and each area requires at least 3 points."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/polygon_zone_display.rst:41
msgid "``点击配置多边形区域``"
msgstr "``Click to configure polygon area``"

